## Case: housing costs element, no earnings

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestHousingNoEarnings:
  output computation content Uc.UniversalCredit

scope TestHousingNoEarnings:
  # Earnings are below the lower work allowance, so nothing is deducted.
  # Maximum amount: 424.90 + 500.00 = 924.90, and 924.90 - 0.00 = 924.90.
  definition computation equals
    output of Uc.UniversalCredit with {
      -- assessment_period_start: |2026-05-01|
